            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But because of you people the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was angry with me and would not listen. Instead, he said, ‘That's enough! Don't mention this again! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go to the peak of Mount Pisgah and look to the north and to the south, to the east and to the west. Look carefully at what you see, because you will never go across the Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give Joshua his instructions. Strengthen his determination, because he will lead the people across to occupy the land that you see.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
